# SwasthyaSetu UI Modernization

I have successfully modernized the user interface for SwasthyaSetu to feature a premium, dynamic Indian/AI aesthetic, without changing the underlying technology stack (Vanilla HTML, Tailwind via CDN, Vanilla JS).

## What Was Changed

*   **Overall Theme**: Migrated from a basic layout to a stunning, animated linear gradient background (`#FF9933` to `#138808` with white and deep blue).
*   **Glassmorphism**: Replaced solid white backgrounds with semi-transparent glass panels (`backdrop-blur`) for the main input form and the report cards.
*   **Typography**: Integrated the modern Google Font `Outfit` for a cleaner, professional look.
*   **Animations**: Added a pulsing AI "ring" around the logo, smooth hover effects on buttons, and an animated, glowing progress bar.
*   **JavaScript Updates ([app.js](file:///f:/All%20Projects/Agentic%20AI%20projects/medsarathi/static/app.js))**: Completely rewrote the HTML string generation inside the [renderReport](file:///f:/All%20Projects/Agentic%20AI%20projects/medsarathi/static/app.js#145-419) function. The diagnosis, triage, routing, and education blocks now render as individualized, stylized cards with thematic colors and icons.
*   **Run Rules**: I also created [.agents/rules/backend_running.md](file:///f:/All%20Projects/Agentic%20AI%20projects/medsarathi/.agents/rules/backend_running.md) so that the backend is always run using `uvicorn` and the virtual environment.

